WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.000 line:73%
Grid-tied, hybrid, o
off-grid: alin ang para sa'yo?

c02
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:08.220 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:13.340 line:73%
Grid-tied: solar at grid ang
magkatuwang, walang battery.

c04
00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.610 line:73%
Kapag brownout, kusa itong
namamatay para sa safety.

c05
00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:22.220 line:73%
Hybrid: may battery, pero
depende sa setup ang backup.

c06
00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:27.250 line:73%
Off-grid: walang grid,
battery ang sandalan sa gabi.

c07
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:31.220 line:73%
Kaya hindi pare-pareho
ang backup ng tatlo.

c08
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:35.670 line:73%
Itanong muna: anong loads
ang kailangan sa brownout?

cz1
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:41.560 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.030 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
